### Dataset Attribution & Usage Notice
The BioScan reference dataset is derived from open-access scientific environmental DNA survey records:
- **Primary Survey**: 2019 New Jersey Bureau of Marine Fisheries Ocean Trawl Survey (NJ OTS).
- **NCBI Repository**: BioProject PRJNA638560.
- **Reference Barcode Marker**: Mitochondrial 12S ribosomal RNA (12S rDNA V5 teleost and elasmobranch locus, 87–112 bp).
This software and associated reference models are intended for academic, research, and conservation benchmarking purposes.
